    "noteZh": "README 分成 What lives here 与 What does not live here 两段，用来说明哪些代码该留在实例里、哪些归到底层包，并点名已有两个实例：galaxyproject/foundry 和 jmchilton/statistical-genomics-foundry。文件树里 apps/gallery、packages、scripts、docs、knip.ts 摆在一起，commit 记录里能看到 @galaxy-foundry/license-policy、@galaxy-foundry/cast 和 stand up foundry-lib 这类包名。",
